# Focus Timer (PomoZen)

- Timer state is **browser local-first** (Zustand + safe localStorage); do not sync to DB without an explicit sprint task.
- Web Worker + Comlink timing must stay off the main thread (`src/workers/timer.worker.ts`).
- Import `cn` from `@/lib/utils` only — not `lib/pomo/utils/cn`.
- UI lives under `src/components/timer/`; route is `(standalone)/timer` at `/timer`.
- Avoid `useEffect` for initial server data; timer page is client-driven.
- Do not refactor store contracts casually — run manual timer QA after changes.
